  (text "IGN: slot switched 12 V (on with the key) -> 15k / 10k (HIGH from about 7.5 V, so cranking sag does not drop it), clamped.\nBATT: slot constant 12 V -> 100k / 22k (16 V -> 2.9 V) on ADC8 (no JTAG pin, no fuse to set).\nWAKE: PWR_HOLD (5 V) -> 4.7k / 10k (3.4 V) -> Schottky -> slot WAKE: keeps the buck on after key-off. WAKE -> 47k -> ADC9 (another card woke the rail)." (at 220 51 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ae008507-8ff9-5655-b0d2-a5648b9765d0"))
